<title>USA: Larson-Davis Inc Q4 loss increases.</title>
<headline>Larson-Davis Inc Q4 loss increases.</headline>
<dateline>PROVO, Utah 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the 3 Month Period    For the 12 Month Period</p>
<p>		     Ended June 30,		 Ended June 30,</p>
<p>			1996	  1995	     1996	 1995</p>
<p> Sales, net  $1,785,904$  2,220,374    $ 8,255,607$ 6,515,830</p>
<p>Net income</p>
<p>		(1,535,332)   (653,933)    (1,706,248)  (311,617)</p>
<p> Earnings	  (0.17)	(0.11)	   (0.19)     (0.05)</p>
<p>per share</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said that the losses are expected and firmly based on the strategic product commercialization plan involving the patented CrossCheck and Sensar technologies.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
